        "adaptation": "The SDK build bundles the upstream picker dependency closure only into the committed-client picker runtime; the public field shell retains its dynamic import. React and React DOM remain external peers. In the ESM runtime, only bare CommonJS require calls for react/react-dom are mapped to explicit SDK-owned ESM namespace/re-export facades, avoiding unsupported browser/Node ESM dynamic require without a global require or Node polyfill. Upstream source modules and licenses are unmodified, and their original input hashes are recorded separately."
